    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it can't be fixed. it's not just a bad patch or a rough time. it's permanent. once people decide you're someone to be avoided, that's it. there's no coming back from this. the world has already moved on and left me behind. it's like i'm already dead anyway, just walking around.",
