    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel like strength though. it just feels like a mistake. like i'm stuck in this loop of being alive when there's nothing left to actually live for. if the world has already decided i don't belong, then why am i even fighting to stay in it? it feels more like i'm just waiting for the inevitable to happen.",
